      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, ive had migraines a ton lately and usually they get pretty bad but this one just hit out of nowhere like a literal hammer. its like the worst pain i ever felt, it just happened in like 5 seconds. i think its just a really bad migraine flare up though right?? im kinda scared to go to the er if it isnt anything serious.",
