      "content": "but i'm literally fine otherwise, i don't have any nausea or light sensitivity like i usually do with my migraines. im just feeling a bit dizzy. honestly the er is just so expensive and stressful and i really think i just need to rest in a dark room. if i just take a really high dose of my migraine meds, like double what i usually take, wont that just knock the pain out so i can sleep? it feels more like a migraine than anything else i promise.",
